{"id":"verpflichtet","lemma":"verpflichtet","pos":"adj","rank":2597,"glosses":["committed, bound, obliged, indebted, beholden"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/93/De-verpflichtet.ogg/De-verpflichtet.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich bin dem sehr verpflichtet.","en":"I'm very committed to this.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Ich bin ihm zu Dank verpflichtet.","en":"I am indebted to him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"thanks"},null]},{"text":"Du bist verpflichtet, ihnen zu helfen.","en":"You're required to help them.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Fühl dich nicht verpflichtet zu gehen.","en":"Don't feel obliged to go.","words":[{"g":"to feel","l":"fühlen"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Du bist nicht verpflichtet, mir zu glauben.","en":"You don't have to believe me.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to believe something"}]}]}